WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:06.000
Herman Van Rompuy is communicating
more and more via Twitter, -

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:11.500
- therefore we have to follow his tweets
as it is verified information -

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:17.000
- that we can use directly for our bulletins.

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:23.500
So obviously,
as far as official sources are concerned, -

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:27.000
- Twitter is an information source for us.

